    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mc Peakes are thrilled in bring no 13 Bridgewater Quay to the market.\r\nThis striking and spacious three bedroom own door Duplex is located within walking distance to the Phoenix Park. This superbly presented property would be a perfect starting home for the  or investors alike or perhaps for those looking to trade down. \r\nThis property is well appointed and is overlooking a green area, the accommodation briefly consists of: entrance hallway, open plan living/dining room with access to balcony through sliding doors, there is a separate kitchen with fully fitted shaker style units, three sizeable double bedroom with the main bedroom to the front with ensuite, and main bathroom. In addition, the property is surrounded by communal gardens and access to the riverside. Bridge water is a highly sought after development,  as its very well maintained development enjoying a wealth of amenities, with local attractions including  Phoenix Park, Heuston South Quarter, The Irish Museum of Modern Art, Kilmainham Goal,  , the Hilton Hotel and Leisure Centre.\r\n\r\nThere are excellent transport facilities, a choice of bus routes, the Luas tram and Heuston station being just over ten minutes’ walk away, and superb access to both sides of the city centre, the M50 and many major national routes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accomodation \r\nEntrance Hallway – Laminate flooring \r\nKitchen (3.27m x 2.46m) – Fully fitted kitchen washing machine, eye level oven, ceramic hob, integrated fridge freezer, integrated microwave, extractor\r\nLiving/dining room (6.80m x 4.75m) – Carpeted, with Feature marble fireplace, access to balcony\r\nStairs – carpeted\r\nFirst floor\r\nBedroom 3 – (4.00m x 1.99m) carpeted with fitted wardrobes \r\nBedroom 2 – (4.00x 2.50m) Double room, fitted wardrobes, Carpeted \r\nBedroom 1 (3.63 x 3.55m) – Large double room with ensuite shower room, fitted wardrobes, carpeted \r\nEnsuite – (2.43m x 0.93m) whb, wc, free standing shower\r\n\r\nMain bathroom - (2.49mx 1.65m) – Laminate flooring, Bath, whb, wc, Electric Shower triton"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "B3 energy Rating \r\nSuper location \r\nOwn balcony\r\nElectric heating\r\nCommunal parking \r\nWell maintained development \r\nBright and spacious \r\nOverlooking green area"
